# RB-001: IOS-XE Upgrade for ISR 4000
Applies to: Cisco ISR 4000 devices running IOS-XE in bundle mode

## S1 Scope and mode check

Confirm that the target device is a Cisco ISR 4000 series router.
Confirm the current IOS-XE version and boot configuration before proceeding.

Commands:
`show version`
`show running-config | include boot`

## S2 Pre-checks

Confirm there is enough free space in bootflash for the new IOS-XE image.
Record the current interface and BGP state so it can be compared after the upgrade.
Confirm the ROMMON version is suitable for the planned software release.

Commands:
`dir bootflash:`
`show version`
`show ip interface brief`
`show ip bgp summary`